"进行加载和显示。如需彻底删除在黑名单中的资源数据，请点击 :guilabel:`删除备份"
"文件` 按钮。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:152
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "标签"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:154
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Krita also has a robust tagging system for you to manage the resources on "
#| "the fly while painting. All Krita resources can be tagged. These tags can "
