#| "Create a new tag by |mouseleft| on the green plus sign.  This will empty "
#| "out the contents of the Brush Preset docker."
msgid ""
"Create a new tag by |mouseleft| on the :guilabel:`+`.  This will empty out "
"the contents of the Brush Preset docker."
msgstr ""
"点击笔刷预设面板的“标签”按钮，用“+”按钮新建一个标签。在此例子中我们将新标签命"
"名为“pencils (铅笔)”。现在笔刷预设面板将自动选中“pencils”标签，且预设列表将被"
"清空 (因为这是一个空标签)。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:195
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Use the :guilabel:`Resource Filter` at the bottom of the :guilabel:`Brush "
#| "Presets` dock or :guilabel:`Brush Settings Editor` to type in what you "
#| "want to group.  For instance: if you type **Pencil** in the filter box "
#| "you will get all Brush Presets with **Pencil** somewhere in their name.  "
#| "Now you have all the Pencil-related Brush Presets together in one place."
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Resource Filter` at the bottom of the :guilabel:`Brush "
"Presets` dock or :guilabel:`Brush Settings Editor` to type in what you want "
"to group.  For instance: if you type ``Pencil`` in the filter box you will "
"get all Brush Presets with ``Pencil`` somewhere in their name.  Now you have "
"all the Pencil-related Brush Presets together in one place."
msgstr ""
"在面板底部的筛选框中输入筛选条件，列出你想要保存到这个新标签下的预设。例如输"
"入“pencil”后，预设列表将列出所有和铅笔有关的预设。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:196
msgid ""
"To finish, click the :guilabel:`Save` button (small disk icon to the right "
"of the :guilabel:`Resource Filter` box) or press the :kbd:`Enter` key and "
"all the items will be saved with the new tag you created."
msgstr ""
"点击筛选框右边的 :guilabel:`保存` 按钮或者在筛选框中按 :kbd:`回车` 键即可将列"
"出的预设保存到“pencils”标签下面。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management.rst:198
msgid ""
"Now, anytime you want to open up your \"digital pencil box\" and see what "
"you have to work with all you have to do is use the pull-down and select :"
"guilabel:`Pencils`.  The Resource Filter works the same way in other parts "
"of Krita so be on the lookout for it!"
msgstr ""
"从现在开始，只要从笔刷预设面板的下拉选单中选中“pencils”标签，面板就会列出所有"
"铅笔类的预设。"

